'''Marauder Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] events. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] increases attack power, health, range and critical chance, along with gaining [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]].

